{"sectionId":"metabolism/storage","items":[{"id":"metabolism--storage-k001","sectionId":"metabolism/storage","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"글리코겐 합성효소는 UDP-glucose를 사용하여 α(1→4)","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--storage-k002","sectionId":"metabolism/storage","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"결합을 연장하고 branching enzyme이 α(1→6)","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--storage-k003","sectionId":"metabolism/storage","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"가지를 만든다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--storage-k004","sectionId":"metabolism/storage","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"Glycogen phosphorylase는 비환원 말단에서 G1P를 방출하고 debranching enzyme이 가지를 처리한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--storage-k005","sectionId":"metabolism/storage","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"간의 glucose-6-phosphatase는 G6P를 포도당으로 전환해 혈당 유지에 기여하지만 골격근에는 실질적으로 없다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--storage-k006","sectionId":"metabolism/storage","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"인슐린은 저장을, 간의 glucagon 및 epinephrine은 글리코겐 분해를 촉진한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--storage-k007","sectionId":"metabolism/storage","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"당신생은 주로 간과 신장에서 젖산, 글리세롤, 당생성 아미노산을 이용한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--storage-k008","sectionId":"metabolism/storage","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"Pyruvate carboxylase와 PEPCK, fructose-1,6-bisphosphatase, glucose-6-phosphatase가 해당의 비가역 단계를 우회한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--storage-k009","sectionId":"metabolism/storage","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"짝수 탄소 지방산의 acetyl-CoA는 사람에서 순 포도당 생산원이 아니다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--storage-k010","sectionId":"metabolism/storage","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"Cori 회로에서 근육·적혈구 유래 젖산이 간에서 포도당으로 재합성된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--storage-k011","sectionId":"metabolism/storage","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"오탄당인산경로 산화 단계는 G6PD로 시작하여 NADPH 및 ribulose-5-phosphate를 만들고, 비산화 단계는 당인산 사이를 가역적으로 전환한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--storage-k012","sectionId":"metabolism/storage","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"NADPH는 지방산 합성 및 환원형 glutathione 재생에 중요하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--storage-k013","sectionId":"metabolism/storage","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"G6PD 결핍 적혈구는 산화 스트레스에 취약하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--storage-k014","sectionId":"metabolism/storage","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"간 글리코겐은 혈당 유지, 근육 글리코겐은 자체 에너지.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--storage-k015","sectionId":"metabolism/storage","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"G6Pase 결핍은 공복 저혈당과 글리코겐 축적을 유발할 수 있다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--storage-k016","sectionId":"metabolism/storage","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"PPP의 산화 단계는 NADPH 생성, 해당과정은 NADH 생성.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"metabolism--storage-k017","sectionId":"metabolism/storage","unitId":"metabolism","subject":"biology","text":"Fructose-1,6-bisphosphatase이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}